File containing useful information regarding BLT's mechanics.

AUSTERE:
	+ Take "The Old Master" focus and choose it over Persuasive.
PERSUASIVE:
	+ Take "The Old Master" focus and choose it over Austere.
DILIGENT:
	+ Complete every focus in any of the 4 starting tree branches, and then take "The Moment of Truth" focus (will also be obtained if focus is bypassed).
	+
BRAVE:
	+ Take "Rebuke The Horned Crown's Authority" and successfully end "The Deserter's Tribunal" event sequence.
	+ Can be gained during the Temple of the Vigilant Star quest if completed with Harira loyalty at more than 45, and if Boltrus is already Erudite.
	- Pussy out of meeting Harira in the first event in the Temple of the Vigilant Star quest.
ERUDITE:
	+ Take "A Proper Judiciary" focus while having less than 3 total traits (not counting Explorer).
	+ Can be gained during the Temple of the Vigilant Star quest if completed with Harira loyalty at more than 45.
GALLANT:
	+ Take "A Disaster Response Fleet" focus and successfully complete the rescue attempt.
TACTICAL:
	+ Take both "Settle the Doctrinal Debate" and "New Fleet, New Role" focuses.
PATIENT:
	+ Have Master Uruway inform King Boltrus of the slavery issue immediately, and then take the "Edict of Interspecies Affairs" focus.
CONNIVING:
	+ Can be gained during the Temple of the Vigilant Star quest if completed with Harira loyalty at more than 45, and if Boltrus is already Erudite and Brave.
HARDENED:
	+
	- Run away from Boltrus' assailant during the Temple of the Vigilant Star quest.
